      "gate": "HighPrimePaymentSplitIdentityClosed",
      "meaning": "顶行槽位精确分裂为 m=1 素数槽、2<=m<P 低载体高素数 payment、以及 P-smooth 合数槽。",
      "proved": true,
      "remaining": "exact split only"
    },
    {
      "closed": true,
      "gate": "PrimeSlotEqualsMOneClosed",
      "meaning": "目标正性正是 m=1 high-prime slot 非空。",
